      },
      "content": "2. Characteristics",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0043",
      "reading_order": 49,
      "section": "2. Characteristics",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 92.159514,
        "t": 722.294876,
        "r": 487.3593359999998,
        "b": 713.4231569281769
      },
      "content": "This machine is two axis CNC lathe with drum type turret, and has the following features."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0044",
      "reading_order": 50,
      "section": "2. Characteristics",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 99.23964600000002,
        "t": 705.254864,
        "r": 292.23887399999995,
        "b": 696.3831449281769
      },
      "content": "Enables both chuck and center works."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0045",
      "reading_order": 51,
      "section": "2. Characteristics",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 99.23964600000002,
        "t": 688.274972,
        "r": 523.5415559999991,
        "b": 662.423360928177
      },
      "content": "Uses AC built-in motor to directly change the speed in a wide range [5,5/7,5 kW (SKT100), 7,5/11 kW (SKT200)]"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0046",
      "reading_order": 52,
      "section": "2. Characteristics",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 99.23864400000002,
        "t": 654.255068,
        "r": 411.2454119999999,
        "b": 645.3833489281769
      },
      "content": "Adapts the constant surface speed function as a standard option."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0047",
      "reading_order": 53,
      "section": "2. Characteristics",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 99.23864400000002,
        "t": 637.2751760000001,
        "r": 511.24300799999986,
        "b": 611.423564928177
      },
      "content": "Adapts the permanent set as a standard option, machines a variety of workpieces in the same setting and uses the tool available in the market."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0048",
      "reading_order": 54,
      "section": "2. Characteristics",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 99.23864400000005,
        "t": 603.2552720000001,
        "r": 521.1477779999999,
        "b": 577.403660928177
      },
      "content": "Epoch-making reduction of the tool indexing time and the turret rotation speed by applying the servo motor-driven tool post."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0049",
      "reading_order": 55,
      "section": "2. Characteristics",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 99.23864400000005,
        "t": 569.2954880000002,
        "r": 430.06898399999994,
        "b": 560.4237689281771
      },
      "content": "Accurate positioning by using the advanced LM-guide and ball screw."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0050",
      "reading_order": 56,
      "section": "2. Characteristics",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 99.23864400000005,
        "t": 552.2554760000002,
        "r": 357.7265879999996,
        "b": 543.383756928177
      },
      "content": "The greatest feed rate (36m/min) of axis in the world."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0051",
      "reading_order": 57,
      "section": "2. Characteristics",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 99.23864400000005,
        "t": 535.2755840000002,
        "r": 436.76535000000086,
        "b": 526.4038649281771
      },
      "content": "Minimized heat displacement in X-axis by double pre-tension structure."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0052",
      "reading_order": 58,
      "section": "2. Characteristics",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 99.23864400000002,
        "t": 518.2956920000003,
        "r": 244.5106080000001,
        "b": 509.423972928177
      },
      "content": "Stable bed structure of 45°."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0053",
      "reading_order": 59,
      "section": "2. Characteristics",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 92.15851200000002,
        "t": 501.25568000000027,
        "r": 480.64192799999995,
        "b": 492.38396092817703
      },
      "content": "Ensures rapid and easier operating by applying the FAUNC Oi-TB CNC of 32 bit."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0054",
      "reading_order": 60,
      "section": "2. Characteristics",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 92.15851200000002,
        "t": 484.27578800000026,
        "r": 469.5067020000001,
        "b": 475.404068928177
      },
      "content": "High quality one with a beautiful color and the cover designed somatologically."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0055",
      "reading_order": 61,
      "section": "2. Characteristics",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 92.15851200000002,
        "t": 467.29589600000025,
        "r": 517.960416,
        "b": 441.38416492817703
      },
      "content": "Adding special accessories enable to maximize the request for automatization and higher productivity."
